rew, central, western, and southern capitals were established, along with many other major settlements and border outposts (Jagchid 1981; Mullie 1922; Perlee 1962; Scott 1975; Steinhardt 1997). All of their capitals were in the region of the Great Wall, and the southern capital was located at present-day Beijing." <br>1. Capital<br>2. Regional capital3. Major settlement4. smaller settlement?<br>"There were about fifty known Khitan settlements." '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2686, 'temperature': 0.2})
