c polity during this period.<br>2. Secondary centre-San José Mogote, San Martin Tilcajete, Yegüih-Lambityeco3. Tertiary centre-relatively small, civic-ceremonial places4. Local villages<br>"Table 5.9. Monte Alban Late I population hierarchy in Oaxaca and Ejutla."<br>Valley of Oaxaca: Level I: 17242; II: 1392-1946; III: 555-879; IV: 233-496; V: 102-221; No rank: 8-98.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2877, 'temperature': 0.2})
