le<br>2. Secondary centres, six suggested settlements (including San José Mogote), Main Plaza with public buildings and temple but smaller than at Monte Albán and population estimates of between 970-1950 people3. Tertiary centres, estimated 30 "large villages" (including Fábrica San José), of 5-10 ha in size, many of which show evidence for public buildings.4. Hamlets, more than 400 "small villages" of 1-3ha with a population less than 200 and no monumental architecture or public buildings<br>"Table 6.4. Monte Alban II population hierarchy in Oaxaca and Ejutla."<br>Valley of Oaxaca: Level I: 14492; II: 979-1947; III: 387-727; IV: 180-343; V: 101-161.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2322, 'temperature': 0.2})
